  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_0224.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este viernes, poco antes de las 20 horas, cuando estaba previsto, ha comenzado con un preg&oacute;n del caballero templario en la Font de Dins la Feria Medieval de Onda , que se extiende por el centro hist&oacute;rico hasta el castillo, <a href=\"http://www.onda.es/la-ciudad/eventos/fira-medieval-2013\" target=\"_blank\">con un amplio y variado programa hasta este domingo</a>. Todo, en 200 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedieval13divendres/img_0134.jpg\" alt=\"img_0134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedieval13divendres/img_0135.jpg\" alt=\"img_0135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedieval13divendres/img_0136.jpg\" alt=\"img_0136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedieval13divendres/img_0137.jpg\" alt=\"img_0137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedieval13divendres/img_0138.jpg\" alt=\"img_0138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedieval13divendres/img_0139.jpg\" alt=\"img_0139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedieval13divendres/img_0140.jpg\" alt=\"img_0140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedieval13divendres/img_0141.jpg\" alt=\"img_0141\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev